1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:05,400
CodeQuest Bob turns an unfamiliar repository into a guided developer growth journey.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:11,700
We start with repository intake. GitHub context becomes the basis for a practical onboarding path.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,900
The quest map becomes the center of the product: setup, exploration, improvement, and first PR.

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,800
Inside each quest, objectives turn scattered maintainer advice into visible, trackable progress.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:31,900
Bob briefing adds a speech layer. If live speech is unavailable, the written guidance still works.

6
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:38,600
Skill Boost Radar saves relevant learning recommendations into the Developer Passport.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,400
First PR Package turns analysis into action: task, commands, draft, checklist, and reviewer notes.

8
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:50,700
The Passport records growth, badges, saved resources, and AI-assisted activity after the session.
